Laputa
======

This product is a modified version of Google AI Edge Gallery
(https://github.com/google-ai-edge/gallery), Copyright 2025 Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license is in
the LICENSE file at the root of this repository.

Modifications by the Laputa contributors:

  - Renamed the application to "Laputa" with the application id
    "com.laputa.host", so it installs alongside the original app.
  - Added a local model-serving mode: a foreground service exposing an
    OpenAI-compatible HTTP API on the loopback interface (127.0.0.1), so that
    other applications on the same device can use the on-device model. See the
    "server" package.

